{"setting":"moon","title":"Apollo 11 · The Eagle has landed","description":"The last four minutes of the first landing on the Moon, on the mission clock.","duration":259.5,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"armstrong","name":"Neil Armstrong","role":"Commander · flying the lander by hand, and saying little","tele":"armstrong.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"aldrin","name":"Buzz Aldrin","role":"Lunar module pilot · reading height and speed aloud","tele":"aldrin.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"capcom","name":"Charlie Duke","role":"CapCom in Houston · the one voice from Earth","tele":"capcom.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":3,"end":7.32,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Eagle, Houston. You’re Go for landing. Over.","intensity":0.5},{"start":8,"end":10.94,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Okay. 3000 at 70.","intensity":0.5},{"start":11.04,"end":16.18,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Roger. Understand. Go for landing. 3000 feet.","intensity":0.5},{"start":16.28,"end":17.55,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Program alarm.","intensity":0.8},{"start":17.65,"end":18.68,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"1201.","intensity":0.8},{"start":19,"end":20.17,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"1201.","intensity":0.7},{"start":20.27,"end":26.58,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Roger. 1201 alarm. We’re Go. Same type. We’re Go.","intensity":0.7},{"start":26.68,"end":29.48,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"2000 feet. 2000 feet.","intensity":0.5},{"start":30,"end":30.89,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Roger.","intensity":0.5},{"start":32,"end":37.82,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"That’s not a bad looking area. Okay. 1000 at 30 is good.","intensity":0.5},{"start":38,"end":40.92,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Eagle, looking great. You’re Go.","intensity":0.5},{"start":50,"end":53.7,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Roger. 1202. We copy it.","intensity":0.5},{"start":56,"end":62.9,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"35 degrees. 35 degrees. 750. Coming down at 23.","intensity":0.5},{"start":63,"end":67.12,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"700 feet, 21 down, 33 degrees.","intensity":0.5},{"start":67.22,"end":68.56,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Pretty rocky area.","intensity":0.5},{"start":68.66,"end":71.05,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"600 feet, down at 19.","intensity":0.5},{"start":71.15,"end":75.47,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"540 feet, down at… 30. Down at 15.","intensity":0.5},{"start":81,"end":86.02,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Okay, 400 feet, down at 9. 58 forward.","intensity":0.5},{"start":87,"end":88.14,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"No problem.","intensity":0.5},{"start":88.24,"end":90.68,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"350 feet, down at 4.","intensity":0.5},{"start":91,"end":93.55,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"330, three and a half down.","intensity":0.5},{"start":97,"end":100.37,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Okay, you’re pegged on horizontal velocity.","intensity":0.5},{"start":101,"end":106.9,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"300 feet, down 3½, 47 forward. Slow it up.","intensity":0.5},{"start":107,"end":111.15,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"1½ down. Ease her down. 270.","intensity":0.5},{"start":113,"end":115.12,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Okay, how’s the fuel?","intensity":0.5},{"start":115.22,"end":116.17,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Eight percent.","intensity":0.5},{"start":117,"end":121.18,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Okay. Here’s a… Looks like a good area here.","intensity":0.5},{"start":121.28,"end":123.4,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"I got the shadow out there.","intensity":0.5},{"start":123.5,"end":127.53,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"250, down at 2½, 19 forward.","intensity":0.5},{"start":128,"end":130.05,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Altitude velocity lights.","intensity":0.5},{"start":131,"end":135.3,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"3½ down, 220 feet, 13 forward.","intensity":0.5},{"start":137,"end":140.12,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"11 forward. Coming down nicely.","intensity":0.5},{"start":140.22,"end":142.67,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Gonna be right over that crater.","intensity":0.5},{"start":142.77,"end":145.66,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"200 feet, 4½ down.","intensity":0.5},{"start":145.76,"end":147.38,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"I got a good spot.","intensity":0.5},{"start":147.48,"end":150.2,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"160 feet, 6½ down.","intensity":0.5},{"start":150.3,"end":154.52,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"5½ down, 9 forward. You’re looking good.","intensity":0.5},{"start":155,"end":156.22,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"120 feet.","intensity":0.5},{"start":160,"end":167,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"100 feet, 3½ down, 9 forward. Five percent. Quantity light.","intensity":0.5},{"start":169,"end":175.71,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Okay. 75 feet. And it’s looking good. Down a half, 6 forward.","intensity":0.5},{"start":177,"end":178.33,"speaker":"capcom","text":"60 seconds.","intensity":0.8},{"start":179,"end":180.02,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Light’s on.","intensity":0.5},{"start":183,"end":189.66,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"60 feet, down 2½. 2 forward. 2 forward. That’s good.","intensity":0.5},{"start":192,"end":196.34,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"40 feet, down 2½. Picking up some dust.","intensity":0.5},{"start":196.44,"end":200.65,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"30 feet, 2½ down. Faint shadow.","intensity":0.5},{"start":200.75,"end":207.78,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"4 forward. 4 forward. Drifting to the right a little. 20 feet, down a half.","intensity":0.5},{"start":207.88,"end":209.04,"speaker":"capcom","text":"30 seconds.","intensity":0.9},{"start":209.14,"end":212.29,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Drifting forward just a little bit; that’s good.","intensity":0.5},{"start":215,"end":216.32,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Contact light.","intensity":0.9},{"start":218,"end":218.91,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Shutdown.","intensity":0.8},{"start":219.01,"end":221.31,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Okay. Engine stop.","intensity":0.5},{"start":221.41,"end":223.11,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"ACA out of detent.","intensity":0.5},{"start":223.21,"end":225.43,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Out of detent. Auto.","intensity":0.5},{"start":225.53,"end":234.49,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Mode control, both auto. Descent engine command override, off. Engine arm, off. 413 is in.","intensity":0.5},{"start":234.59,"end":236.67,"speaker":"capcom","text":"We copy you down, Eagle.","intensity":0.5},{"start":236.77,"end":241.27,"speaker":"armstrong","text":"Houston, Tranquility Base here. The Eagle has landed.","intensity":1},{"start":241.37,"end":253.37,"speaker":"capcom","text":"Roger, Twan… Tranquility. We copy you on the ground. You got a bunch of guys about to turn blue. We’re breathing again. Thanks a lot.","intensity":0.9},{"start":253.47,"end":254.32,"speaker":"aldrin","text":"Thank you.","intensity":0.5}],"shots":[{"time":0,"view":"wide"},{"time":2.75,"view":"capcom"},{"time":7.75,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":10.79,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":16.03,"view":"wide"},{"time":17.4,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":18.75,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":20.02,"view":"capcom"},{"time":26.43,"view":"wide"},{"time":29.75,"view":"capcom"},{"time":31.75,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":37.75,"view":"capcom"},{"time":55.75,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":62.75,"view":"wide"},{"time":66.97,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":70.9,"view":"wide"},{"time":86.75,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":87.99,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":90.75,"view":"wide"},{"time":100.75,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":106.75,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":112.75,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":114.97,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":116.75,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":121.03,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":127.75,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":130.75,"view":"wide"},{"time":136.75,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":145.51,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":147.23,"view":"wide"},{"time":150.05,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":154.75,"view":"landing-ground"},{"time":159.75,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":168.75,"view":"wide"},{"time":176.75,"view":"capcom"},{"time":178.75,"view":"aldrin"},{"time":182.75,"view":"landing-ground"},{"time":191.75,"view":"wide"},{"time":196.19,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":200.5,"view":"landing-ground"},{"time":207.63,"view":"capcom"},{"time":208.89,"view":"landing-ground"},{"time":217.75,"view":"landing-crew"},{"time":222.96,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":225.28,"view":"landing-above"},{"time":234.34,"view":"capcom"},{"time":236.52,"view":"armstrong"},{"time":241.12,"view":"capcom"},{"time":253.22,"view":"landing-crew"},{"time":255.12,"view":"wide"}]}